Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: if EEVDF scheduling fail, picking leftmost, to avoid
 NULL pointer.

vruntime_eligible function may always return false, if (vruntime - cfs_rq->min_vruntime) * load overflow.
lead to pick_eevdf return NULL.

